{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "cec78f519da002b00c5d4ff23c66b81969b17f345a9c7666b2c2ea3f304303a5", "ja": "そういえば前に、社長さんと音無先輩と\nバンドを組んだことがあったよね。", "zh": "说起来，以前还和社长先生、音无前辈一起组过乐队呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "327800600dfabb51043994437a6083df8431195c4fcb202ba810418982691238", "ja": "ステージに立つのは緊張したけど、大声で歌って、\nみんなの歓声を浴びて……楽しかったなぁ♪", "zh": "站上舞台时虽然很紧张，但放声歌唱，沐浴在大家的欢呼声中……真开心呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "51b61ccf36acb5e18816039bee3ed6e7991256cec19a3e62fcd995ffb10fcaf3", "ja": "ヘイ！　オーディエンス！\nまだまだ声、出せるよな～！？", "zh": "嘿！各位观众！\n还可以再大声一点吧～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e4e737a5ef244764bde4e33c0611eabb48ba6793fdbe420941e0d4605ab59a6f", "ja": "い、いえ～い……。", "zh": "耶、耶～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "33e5856facadb5fa700b1bca4c6313e6ee4e44af8755a00b12ab55e0122302ea", "ja": "きゃっ！\n{$P$}さん、いつからそこに！？", "zh": "呀！\n{$P$}先生，你什么时候来的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4431515b4026ab5f4e22a7136deae780781ee7a10ad3946a4853899ebcd39b0c", "ja": "すみません、声をかけるタイミングを見失って。\nなんだか楽しそうでしたね。", "zh": "抱歉，我一时没找到合适的时机叫您。\n感觉您刚才好像很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "3025d8c1f6caea12469f87b39c7ea89685419c2c39323aeaccbefa9a6544d153", "ja": "えへへ、すみません。『プレジデント・ジャム・イン』\nの思い出が急に蘇って、つい。", "zh": "嘿嘿，不好意思。“总统即兴演奏会”的回忆突然涌上心头，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b793f2ed8b15e75b526034a38bee22cb206907e3481150a03f9676ff37e1bbc8", "ja": "ああ、懐かしいですね。社長が立ち上げた、\n伝説のハードコアロックバンド……。", "zh": "啊啊，真让人怀念。那可是社长组建的、传说中的硬核摇滚乐队……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "76673e9f370dda27a4fdd15bad844d9d08e448c12e372505bf3a190153b28bae", "ja": "あっそうだ、バンドと言えば！　社長さんが\n{$P$}さんをお呼びでしたよ！", "zh": "啊对了，说到乐队！社长\n刚才在找{$P$}先生哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "602011f861e80a16bc396e0bfb9fe7ecb7b6d33291c0c3e4002134b3fad3ff47", "ja": "なんでも、\n新しいライブハウスがオープンするとか……？", "zh": "听说，好像有家新的Live House要开业了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3fdf60aeda9313a360c6e19c4355ad71286f0159778c1f7c12f52bc601a0aea3", "ja": "おお、それはいいニュースの予感がしますね。\nさっそく行ってきます！", "zh": "哦，感觉会是个好消息呢。 我这就去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1011_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "3404ffcc7629b7573602fdbdbfaaa788b7b3e710c12372691a50a7262349882d", "ja": "君……。\n今度こそ私達と、バンドを組んでみないかね！？", "zh": "你……\n这次一定要和我们组个乐队试试看吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bc0e00439141e66c93c9f3392ba8d86fa298c4dc4e59e58cd5d993d1ca699e90", "ja": "えっ、もしかして今日のお話って、\n『プレジデント・ジャム・イン』の……？", "zh": "诶，难道说今天要谈的是……『总统即兴演奏会』的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "f765cb164e9f9c618931f58a949c085d91d68906b9638398f3b60d1e96f18a0f", "ja": "いや、本題は別なんだがね。新しいライブハウスの話を\n聞いて、私もあの時の情熱が蘇ってきたのだよ。", "zh": "不，正题是另一回事。听说了新Live House的事，我也重新燃起了当时的热情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "125305b0ed0aebc2a5aa65a2df6e8067b8f5e251da5e60cf4010db15754f7eee", "ja": "楽しかったですよね、あのライブ♪\n練習は、だいぶ大変でしたけど……。", "zh": "那场演出很开心，对吧♪\n虽然练习确实挺辛苦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "6e713e1d5989bc3c943eab2f1bedf27702f2e08c5396be0e45e35eba950990a7", "ja": "どうだね。\n前回は断られたが、今回は君も一緒に……。", "zh": "怎么样？上次被拒绝了，不过这次你也一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9a1f4133de745e4588177703435a2ca58d125c5f7364b991a73703bb0d3c6e19", "ja": "お断りします。", "zh": "我拒绝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "d7910acaaa8c54ba4eaafe8ec5538e27853c6dbb4eae2b163bd431622dab60dd", "ja": "ううっ……！　流石、君は決断が早いなぁ！", "zh": "呜呜……！真不愧是你，做决断可真快啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "903a80cafa3308fc37d5853e4300d689309def7bb9a8baf77e072836175ee675", "ja": "また振られちゃいましたね、社長。", "zh": "又被拒绝了呢，社长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "88b8ef83c9211454bb5db8336f43f850d93419054f429da2c170ea6a45fa7c2e", "ja": "すみません。最近アイドルたちの仕事も増えていますし\nバンド練習に割く時間がなかなか取れそうになくて。", "zh": "对不起。最近偶像们的工作也增加了，恐怕很难抽出时间来练习乐队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "819bc44e84a46d11c63d17f0a8cf29474d27e37aca587cba177d4111497793dd", "ja": "それで社長、\n時間もないのでそろそろ本題を……。", "zh": "所以社长，我们时间也不多了，差不多该进入正题了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "6b5a6b316d20448380cf9bab00123ae2fdd3f876906328ee34d65d55164c0e8e", "ja": "おっと、そうだっだね。\n君は『庭園』というライブハウスを覚えているかい？", "zh": "哦，对了，是这样呢。\n你还记得有一家名为《庭园》的Live House吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f75a6a3b90265ce17b7f63d37dd9018c353f214a675c4425f438b55043ef357a", "ja": "『≡君彩≡』の3人がお世話になった、\n老舗ライブハウスでしたね。", "zh": "就是“≡君彩≡”的那3个人受过关照的，\n那家老牌Livehouse吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9663415ce2495516d0c39721e3860220ab281f9320ec7063d53ca1421cf9ec31", "ja": "社長は、オーナーとご友人とか……\nしかし、『庭園』はもう閉店してますよね？", "zh": "社长和老板是朋友吗……\n不过，『庭园』不是已经关门了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "33628cc638a329f295c4345810a5b676474c10f7b0c0474939c9d21280cf1925", "ja": "その跡地に、また新しいライブハウスができたのだよ。\nそこで今回、こけら落とし公演をすることになってね。", "zh": "在那片旧址上，又建起了一家新的Live House。  \n这次，我们决定在那里举行开业首演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "753455b709c1c30430fa514692ba4173b0aa86531d8334dbe69c1aa06d01ff2f", "ja": "ぜひ『≡君彩≡』の3人にも出演してもらえないかと、\n新しいオーナーから声がかかったんだ！", "zh": "新老板联系我，想邀请《≡君彩≡》的3人也来出演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2cd8914cda00fd87087b043e73c58193f57850949c6f41443b950906a9caeb18", "ja": "そういうことでしたか。\n『≡君彩≡』の再集結、きっとみんなも喜びます！", "zh": "原来是这样啊。『≡君彩≡』的三位再次聚首，大家一定也会很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "e42da0baa43a9a97305e3d8798f5eefe64e7361d1425e5e174d49e3d806eea65", "ja": "うむ！　私も、また彼女達の熱い演奏が聞けるのを\n楽しみにしているよ！", "zh": "嗯！我也很期待能再次听到她们热情洋溢的演奏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ad877f707f5a56a73407208a6baea1195fc514e8f997f6f6e9768b3111acaab0", "ja": "ただ、以前よりみんな忙しいですから。\n楽器の練習時間が取れるか、心配ですね……。", "zh": "不过，大家都比以前忙了。\n不知道还能不能抽出时间练习乐器，真让人担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "48e6df2b0313bbc89edae6d099c68f111fbfdb47e298fa3b876464c95ae03941", "ja": "でもそこが、{$P$}さんの\n腕の見せ所なんですよね？　頑張ってくださいね！", "zh": "不过，这正是展现{$P$}先生本领的地方，对吧？请加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "8d6c7e521dfbe7d8a92db8b86f63bbf8609b2c09685c186c96a5e79d617e7f39", "ja": "はい！　みんなと協力して、\n最高のライブにしてみせます！", "zh": "好的！我会和大家一起努力，打造出最棒的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0425_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0425_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "d399933010611418bf8e971225ab03347c161091ad49c127f730204c2623d087", "ja": "いい返事だ！\n今回も、よろしく頼んだよ～！", "zh": "回答得真有精神！\n这次也拜托你啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
